te","body":"Lead with task success. Rank issues by severity (impact × frequency). Every issue has evidence (a quote or a count) and a recommendation with an owner.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"usabilityreport-c5","type":"note","x":56,"y":335,"w":348,"h":127,"title":"Headline","body":"Choosing a slot works well (5/5). Understanding the total cost does not (2/5). Fix the delivery-cost display before launch.","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"usabilityreport-c4"},{"id":"usabilityreport-c6","type":"table","x":56,"y":478,"w":348,"h":265,"title":"Task success","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"cells":[["Task","Success","Avg time"],["1 · Choose delivery","5/5","1:12"],["2 · Change delivery","4/5","0:48"],["3 · State total","2/5","—"]],"sectionId":"usabilityreport-c4"},{"id":"usabilityreport-c7","type":"image","x":460,"y":280,"w":640,"h":398,"title":"Task success — 5 participants","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"@image:gen-chart-4b2a958a97","filename":"gen-chart-4b2a958a97.png","boardId":null},{"id":"usabilityreport-c9","type":"note","x":1156,"y":335,"w":268,"h":107,"title":"Score","body":"71 / 100 — “good”, below our 75 target.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"usabilityreport-c8"},{"id":"usabilityreport-ca","type":"note","x":1156,"y":458,"w":268,"h":87,"title":"Range","body":"58–86","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"usabilityreport-c8"},{"id":"usabilityreport-cc","type":"note","x":56,"y":870,"w":408,"h":107,"title":"Delivery cost appears only on the payment page","body":"3 of 5 thought delivery was free. “Wait — £49? Where did that come from